n  agreement on anything  republicans have floated the idea of a  narrow short-term negotiated deal  but house speaker nancy pelosi has  rejected that she says that republicans  put them  up against the wall by refusing to  negotiate for two months  but in a peace offering of sorts the  white house has offered congress  additional testing capability now that  over a dozen lawmakers have contracted  the virus  anthony paula reed thanks paula
 

